<title>INDIA: India's Otis Elevators 1996/97 net up.</title>
<headline>India's Otis Elevators 1996/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 152.6   vs   115.1</p>
<p>    Net sales		 2,113.7  vs  1,912.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (in rupees)	5.0  vs	N.A.</p>
<p>    Shr (in rupees)	    12.17 vs	9.18</p>
<p>    Other income		 81.7  vs     88.4</p>
<p>    Interest			4.9  vs	0.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation		 44.6  vs     28.4</p>
<p>    Taxation		    110.0  vs    112.5</p>
<p>Note: Otis Elevator Company (India) Ltd said it had begun the 1997/98 financial year with bookings of 385.8 million and sales of 222.3 million in April and May.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
